  "prefLabel": "Res 213.01 Conclusion of Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 213.01 Conclusion of Hearing. No party shall be required to rest his or her case at a particular time, except when the presiding officer is reasonably certain that all relevant evidence, cross-examination and rebuttal have been heard.\n\nSource. #7568-A, eff 10-1-01, EXPIRED: 7-1-18",
